Spec: Bounded Android client workers

Purpose:
  Bound blocked platform calls and timers without spawning replacement workers after timeouts.

Owns:
  ./ClientRuntime.java

Must:
  Use at most two worker threads with no work queue, one timer thread and eight active client leases per runtime.
  Allow a single process-wide SDK runtime and release each client lease only once.
  Remove cancelled timer tasks and reject overload without blocking.
